<title>CANADA: Zenon to acquire remaining stake of unit.</title>
<headline>Zenon to acquire remaining stake of unit.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Ontario 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zenon Environmental Inc said on Thursday it signed a letter of intent with Enjay Inc, a unit of Exxon Corp, for the purchase by Zenon of Enjay's 36.5 percent interest in Zenon Environmental Systems Inc, a Zenon subsidiary.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Zenon said negotiation of a definitive agreement was expected to be finalized by the end of the quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;The 100 percent ownership of our subsidiary company will enable Zenon to simplify its corporate structure, producing significant cost savings from operational synergies,&quot; Zenon Chief Executive Andrew Benedek said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
